      "text": "The boat keeps moving through that is enough for me and you."
    },
    {
      "start": 170.96,
      "end": 175.4,
      "text": "I thought of a spare key to houses I never lived in."
    },
    {
      "start": 176.12,
      "end": 183.42,
      "text": "I thought of second best weather, standing outside the main vent with dampers, soft and a useful face."
    },
    {
      "start": 184.12,
      "end": 186.94,
      "text": "I'd see useful is not a punishment."
    },
    {
      "start": 189.36,
      "end": 200.82,
      "text": "I'd see the person with the cup keeps everyone float past the old bowl together, not every mercy needs good weather."
    },
    {
      "start": 201.14,
